<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.654" end="00:00:02.674" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.239" end="00:00:07.259" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.600" end="00:00:12.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] you sleep that hard in this</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.000" end="00:00:12.800" style="s2">drafty barn.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.300" end="00:00:17.800" style="s2">Once you climb that old noble&#39;s bed,</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.900" end="00:00:20.400" style="s2">you&#39;ll never want to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.800" end="00:00:23.580" style="s2">Go get ready for the wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.400" end="00:00:25.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I won&#39;t marry him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.580" end="00:00:27.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.400" end="00:00:29.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You defying me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.000" end="00:00:31.800" style="s2">I&#39;m your father.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.200" end="00:00:31.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father?</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.100" end="00:00:39.200" style="s2">My real father&#39;s dead. You killed him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.600" end="00:00:41.100" style="s2">You took my mom, sold her to a brothel.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.200" end="00:00:43.230" style="s2">Now you&#39;re selling me to some old man.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.100" end="00:00:45.250" style="s2">You&#39;re a monster.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.230" end="00:00:45.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.600" end="00:00:48.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t notice you&#39;ve gotten so big up</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.100" end="00:00:51.000" style="s2">top.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.900" end="00:00:54.100" style="s2">Relax. I won&#39;t touch you. Virgin sell</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.000" end="00:00:54.100" style="s2">for more, just to feel.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.020" end="00:00:57.900" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.100" end="00:00:59.100" style="s2">Still fighting?</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.900" end="00:01:02.100" style="s2">If you weren&#39;t worth good money, I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.100" end="00:01:02.100" style="s2">have [ __ ] you [music] already.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.300" end="00:01:07.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dean?</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.500" end="00:01:08.900" style="s2">You&#39;re here to save me?</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.800" end="00:01:09.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.900" end="00:01:12.300" style="s2">I&#39;m here to tell you I&#39;m getting</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.900" end="00:01:14.300" style="s2">married. Stop bothering me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.300" end="00:01:15.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bothering? You said you&#39;d marry me just</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.300" end="00:01:17.300" style="s2">two days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.600" end="00:01:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s old [music] news.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.300" end="00:01:22.500" style="s2">I&#39;m marrying the earl&#39;s daughter now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.000" end="00:01:24.400" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing compared to her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.500" end="00:01:26.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least save me for all the years we&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.400" end="00:01:29.600" style="s2">had together. Please. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.800" end="00:01:29.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get off me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.700" end="00:01:33.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.000" end="00:01:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.000" end="00:01:37.800" style="s2">No one loves you. Everyone leaves you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.000" end="00:01:39.100" style="s2">Come with me quietly. That old man will</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.800" end="00:01:40.600" style="s2">get tired of you eventually, but at</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.100" end="00:01:44.500" style="s2">least you&#39;ll earn me cash.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.600" end="00:01:44.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I have to get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.200" end="00:01:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.592" end="00:02:14.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A thousand years.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.292" end="00:02:16.192" style="s2">You&#39;re the first one who can touch this</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.592" end="00:02:17.551" style="s2">barrier.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.192" end="00:02:18.492" style="s2">Maybe she can help me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.551" end="00:02:21.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.492" end="00:02:21.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.692" end="00:02:28.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila, you [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.392" end="00:02:31.592" style="s2">WHERE ARE YOU HIDING?</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.192" end="00:02:33.392" style="s2">LILA, you [ __ ] Where are you hiding?</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.592" end="00:02:35.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sleep with me once</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.392" end="00:02:37.492" style="s2">and I&#39;ll fix your mess.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.292" end="00:02:39.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.492" end="00:02:41.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once I have [music] your scent on me,</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.892" end="00:02:43.392" style="s2">then I can leave this place.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.992" end="00:02:44.592" style="s2">When are you going to give yourself to</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.392" end="00:02:45.792" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.592" end="00:02:48.391" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Figures.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.792" end="00:02:48.391" style="s2">All men are the same. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.991" end="00:02:52.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.392" end="00:02:52.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found you, [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.792" end="00:02:55.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come close to me and I can protect</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.231" end="00:02:57.892" style="s2">[music] you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.592" end="00:03:01.092" style="s2">But you&#39;ll be mine.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.892" end="00:03:01.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have no way to go.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.747" end="00:03:04.767" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.392" end="00:03:08.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Power,</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.392" end="00:03:09.692" style="s2">it&#39;s surging.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.192" end="00:03:12.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think hiding behind some guy gets</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.692" end="00:03:12.492" style="s2">you away from me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.292" end="00:03:17.692" style="s2">What are you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.892" end="00:03:21.592" style="s2">You&#39;re a demon?</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.392" end="00:03:29.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now,</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.592" end="00:03:29.592" style="s2">keep your end of the deal.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.912" end="00:03:32.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.737" end="00:03:44.067" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.047" end="00:03:44.067" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.942" end="00:03:49.962" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.457" end="00:03:58.477" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.294" end="00:04:09.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.394" end="00:04:12.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many times have I told you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.294" end="00:04:13.894" style="s2">No magic out in public.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.294" end="00:04:15.294" style="s2">If they find out, they&#39;ll burn you at</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.894" end="00:04:18.394" style="s2">the stake.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.294" end="00:04:19.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, we won&#39;t do it again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.394" end="00:04:22.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go buy it</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.794" end="00:04:22.894" style="s2">and pay for the one you ruined, too.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.694" end="00:04:36.694" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t long before I found out I was</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.194" end="00:04:37.723" style="s2">pregnant.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.694" end="00:04:40.294" style="s2">I just want to live quiet with my</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.723" end="00:04:40.294" style="s2">[music] kids</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.694" end="00:04:43.994" style="s2">and stay hidden from that demon.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.094" end="00:05:08.494" style="s2">What&#39;s he doing here? He can&#39;t find me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.694" end="00:05:08.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why does this kid look so much like me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.694" end="00:05:13.894" style="s2">Could they be mine</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.194" end="00:05:13.894" style="s2">and that woman&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.953" end="00:05:22.973" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.194" end="00:05:29.194" style="s2">They&#39;re not mine.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.694" end="00:05:30.894" style="s2">No demons sent on them.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.194" end="00:05:33.394" style="s2">Where is she,</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.894" end="00:05:33.394" style="s2">that woman?</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.494" end="00:05:44.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank God.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.994" end="00:05:46.794" style="s2">The witch&#39;s necklace hides the demons&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.494" end="00:05:46.794" style="s2">scent.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.094" end="00:06:03.894" style="s2">I&#39;m going into town. Be good. Don&#39;t make</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.294" end="00:06:06.495" style="s2">a mess.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.894" end="00:06:06.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it, mum.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.769" end="00:06:10.789" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.095" end="00:06:24.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.295" end="00:06:32.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam,</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.295" end="00:06:36.095" style="s2">these kids have demon blood. Drink it</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.795" end="00:06:36.095" style="s2">and you&#39;ll stay young forever.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.695" end="00:06:57.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.895" end="00:06:57.295" style="s2">Kian?</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.595" end="00:07:05.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sold those two brats.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.895" end="00:07:07.695" style="s2">Now it&#39;s your turn.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.295" end="00:07:09.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sold them?</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.695" end="00:07:10.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hell yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.095" end="00:07:13.895" style="s2">Who knew two little brats would get me a</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.695" end="00:07:13.895" style="s2">whole bag of gold?</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.095" end="00:07:17.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.295" end="00:07:22.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU CRAZY [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.820" end="00:07:22.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.795" end="00:07:30.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE&#39;D YOU TAKE THEM?</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.395" end="00:07:34.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AT THE DUCHESS. Too late now. Those</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.795" end="00:07:34.695" style="s2">brats are probably already drained dry.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.195" end="00:07:44.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.295" end="00:07:44.195" style="s2">Kian, are you in there?</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.195" end="00:07:52.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lyla?</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.295" end="00:07:59.795" style="s2">What are you doing here still clinging</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.695" end="00:07:59.795" style="s2">to me after all this time?</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.895" end="00:08:05.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, this is your house?</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.895" end="00:08:07.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.495" end="00:08:09.397" style="s2">I married the Duke&#39;s daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.595" end="00:08:12.097" style="s2">If you want to be my mistress,</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.397" end="00:08:12.097" style="s2">I might consider it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.297" end="00:08:15.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t flatter yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.897" end="00:08:18.397" style="s2">I&#39;m here for my kids.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.297" end="00:08:18.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Kids?</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.097" end="00:08:21.597" style="s2">You&#39;re married?</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.397" end="00:08:31.497" style="s2">But you&#39;ve got a better body now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.297" end="00:08:34.497" style="s2">I have never been date with a married</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.497" end="00:08:34.497" style="s2">woman before, honestly.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.197" end="00:08:38.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.497" end="00:08:54.697" style="s2">Dean.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.097" end="00:08:54.697" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.297" end="00:09:00.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ophelia.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.997" end="00:09:02.401" style="s2">When did you get back? She came onto me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.381" end="00:09:02.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying]</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.197" end="00:09:09.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Laura.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.697" end="00:09:09.797" style="s2">Ken.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.297" end="00:09:24.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.197" end="00:09:27.797" style="s2">I&#39;d never touch trash like her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.997" end="00:09:27.797" style="s2">Let me teach her a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.397" end="00:09:34.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good job, Dean.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.697" end="00:09:46.897" style="s2">I&#39;ve seen so many [ __ ] [music] like you</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.197" end="00:09:48.997" style="s2">chasing other women&#39;s husbands.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.897" end="00:09:51.597" style="s2">Too bad he&#39;ll always love me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.997" end="00:09:51.597" style="s2">Save your breath.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.497" end="00:09:57.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want your husband.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.676" end="00:10:03.597" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.297" end="00:10:03.597" style="s2">Just let MY CHILDREN GO.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.397" end="00:10:07.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OH, so you&#39;re their mother.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.597" end="00:10:15.898" style="s2">Then you&#39;re definitely not leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.198" end="00:10:33.398" style="s2">You&#39;re already dressing up to seduce men</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.598" end="00:10:36.667" style="s2">at this age?</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.398" end="00:10:38.687" style="s2">Just like your [ __ ] mother.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.667" end="00:10:38.687" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.898" end="00:10:45.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it out on me. Leave my kids alone.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.798" end="00:10:54.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.098" end="00:10:55.498" style="s2">That demon sent. Could they really be my</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.398" end="00:10:57.898" style="s2">kids?</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.498" end="00:11:00.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, you can&#39;t go. You&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.898" end="00:11:01.557" style="s2">weak. If your demon identity is exposed,</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.698" end="00:11:01.598" style="s2">it&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.557" end="00:11:03.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.598" end="00:11:06.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, but finding that woman fixes</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.398" end="00:11:06.998" style="s2">everything. She gives me power.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.298" end="00:11:27.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.898" end="00:11:32.398" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you die the slowest, most</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.998" end="00:11:32.398" style="s2">painful death. What are you going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.298" end="00:11:36.498" style="s2">Watch your kids bleed dry right in front</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.498" end="00:11:37.498" style="s2">of you,</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.498" end="00:11:40.498" style="s2">and you won&#39;t be [music] able to do a</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.498" end="00:11:40.498" style="s2">thing about it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.498" end="00:11:48.063" style="s2">You&#39;ll pay for this.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.898" end="00:11:49.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.063" end="00:11:51.598" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.598" end="00:11:52.598" style="s2">You&#39;re so naive. You have no idea how</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.598" end="00:11:55.298" style="s2">the rich work. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.598" end="00:11:57.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lila, money is power here.</p>
